[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8109.35, "timestamp": "02:15:09", "text": "我很懷念那些。 Dio。 [音樂] 對，我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8118.47, "timestamp": "02:15:18", "text": "不久前還常常那樣做。是的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8131.27, "timestamp": "02:15:31", "text": "來問問你的可信度。哦，等等。在我問這個問題之前，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8139.109, "timestamp": "02:15:39", "text": "我想先問問你是否會寫日文之類的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8142.069, "timestamp": "02:15:42", "text": "所以，嗯，如果是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8153.51, "timestamp": "02:15:53", "text": "這樣的話，嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8157.189, "timestamp": "02:15:57", "text": "你會"}]